@SelfStorageAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5046
@customerToken = replace-with-customer-access-token

GET {{SelfStorageAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get signature status for the authenticated customer's contract
GET {{SelfStorageAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contracts/1/signature
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Sign an active contract (use a PNG data URL from the signature canvas)
POST {{SelfStorageAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contracts/1/signature
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "signatureImage": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mP8/x8AAwMCAO+jEtgAAAAASUVORK5CYII=",
  "termsVersion": "storage-rental-v1",
  "acceptedTerms": true
}
